warning[identity_op]: `count * 1` is just `count`: `*` with this operand changes nothing
  --> tests/lint/identity_op/example.jai:4:12
   |
 4 |     return count * 1;
   |            ^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write `count`
   |
 4 ~     return count;
   |
   = note: `identity_op` is `warn` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/identity_op
